{"speciesId":197,"names":{"fr":"Noctali","es":"Umbreon","en":"Umbreon","ja":"ブラッキー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When agitated, this POKéMON pro­ tects itself by spraying poisonous sweat from its pores."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"When darkness falls, the rings on the body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"On the night of a full moon, or when it gets excited, the ring patterns on its body glow yellow."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"UMBREON evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"UMBREON evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"UMBREON evolved from exposure to the moon’s energy pulses. It lurks in darkness and waits for its foes to move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When darkness falls, the rings on its body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When agitated, this POKéMON protects itself by spraying poisonous sweat from its pores."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The light of the moon changed EEVEE’s genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The light of the moon changed EEVEE’s genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When agitated, this Pokémon protects itself by spraying poisonous sweat from its pores."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When darkness falls, the rings on the body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il s’expose à la lumière de la lune, ses anneaux brillent et il obtient un mystérieux pouvoir."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il s’expose à la lumière de la lune, ses anneaux brillent et il obtient un mystérieux pouvoir."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it’s filled with a mysterious power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it’s filled with a mysterious power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La lumière de la lune a modifié le code génétique d’Évoli. Il hante les ombres en quête d’une proie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Creado cuando la luz lunar alteró la estructura genética de Eevee. Busca presas en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The light of the moon changed Eevee’s genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"月の 光が イーブイの 遺伝子を 変化させた。 闇に 潜み 獲物を 待つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il s’expose à la lumière de la lune, ses anneaux brillent et il développe de mystérieux pouvoirs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando lo baña la luz de la luna, los círculos de su pelaje brillan levemente y se ve revestido de un poder misterioso."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it’s filled with a mysterious power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"月の 波動を 浴びると 全身の 輪っか模様が 光り 不思議な 力に あふれるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Noctali a évolué suite à une longue exposition aux rayons lunaires. Il se cache dans les recoins sombres et attend patiemment le passage de ses ennemis. Les anneaux sur son corps s’illuminent au moment où il bondit."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Umbreon evolucionó tras haber estado expuesto a ondas lunares. Suele esconderse en la oscuridad en silencio y esperar a que su presa se mueva. Cuando se lanza al ataque, le brillan los anillos del cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Umbreon evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"月の 波動を 受けて 進化した ポケモン。 暗闇に じっと 潜み 相手を うかがう。 襲いかかる とき 体の 輪っかが 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Noctali a évolué suite à une longue exposition aux rayons lunaires. Il se cache dans les recoins sombres et attend patiemment le passage de ses ennemis. Les anneaux sur son corps s’illuminent au moment où il bondit."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Umbreon evolucionó tras haber estado expuesto a ondas lunares. Suele esconderse en la oscuridad en silencio y esperar a que su presa se mueva. Cuando se lanza al ataque, le brillan los anillos del cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Umbreon evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"月の 波動を 受けて 進化した ポケモン。 暗闇に じっと 潜み 相手を うかがう。 襲いかかる とき 体の 輪っかが 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Quand il s’énerve, ses pores sécrètent une sueur empoisonnée qu’il envoie dans les yeux de ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando se enfurece, secreta un sudor venenoso por los poros que lanza a los ojos de sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When this Pokémon becomes angry, its pores secrete a poisonous sweat, which it sprays at its opponent’s eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"怒ると 全身の 毛穴から 毒素の 混じった 汗を 吹き出し 相手の 目を 狙う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son pelage noir lui permet de se fondre dans la nuit. Il attend que sa proie baisse sa garde pour l’attaquer en visant la gorge."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Su pelaje le permite camuflarse en la oscuridad, donde espera con paciencia a que su presa se distraiga para saltarle al cuello."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"With its black fur, it blends into the darkness. It bides its time, and when prey appears, this Pokémon goes for its throat, and then eats it."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"闇に 溶け込む 黒い 体毛。 じっと 獲物の 隙を うかがい 喉笛 目掛けて 喰いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les larges pupilles de ce Pokémon nocturne lui permettent de distinguer parfaitement ses proies même dans l’obscurité la plus profonde."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon de hábitos nocturnos. Sus grandes pupilas le permiten distinguir con total claridad a sus presas en la más densa oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This Pokémon is nocturnal. Even in total darkness, its large eyes can spot its prey clearly!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"夜行性の ポケモン。 大きな 瞳は 真っ暗闇でも 獲物の 姿を ハッキリと とらえるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se cache dans la pénombre pour chasser. Les anneaux sur son corps brillent d’une aura lugubre quand il passe à l’attaque."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Acecha a sus presas al amparo de la oscuridad. Sus círculos emiten un brillo ominoso cuando se dispone a saltar al ataque."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It lurks in the dark of night looking for prey. At the moment it pounces, the rings on its body glow dimly but ominously."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"闇夜に 潜み 獲物を 狙う。 襲いかかる 瞬間 身体の 輪っかが 鈍く あやしく 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand il s’énerve, ses pores sécrètent une sueur empoisonnée qu’il projette dans les yeux de ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando se enfurece, secreta un sudor venenoso por los poros que lanza a los ojos de sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When this Pokémon becomes angry, its pores secrete a poisonous sweat, which it sprays at its opponent’s eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"怒ると 全身の 毛穴から 毒素の 混じった 汗を 噴き出し 相手の 目を 狙う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les nuits de pleine lune, ou s’il est agité, les anneaux sur sa peau se mettent à briller."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"En las noches de luna llena, o cuando se exalta, le empiezan a brillar los anillos de color dorado."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"On the night of a full moon, or when it gets excited, the ring patterns on its body glow yellow."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"満月の 夜や 興奮 したとき 全身の 輪っか模様は 黄色く 光る。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"It is most active in the wee hours of the night, when moonlight bathes the land. Its large eyes can pierce the darkness and perceive prey with absolute clarity."}],"varieties":[{"id":197,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[3,"level-up",8],[4,"level-up",8],[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"l